<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:00:55 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>拥有环球小姐选美比赛的特朗普吹捧共和党候选人有多么英俊，甚至称赞他们身体的某些部位。 “看看这个漂亮的家伙”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/trump-miss-universe-pageant-handsome-gop-candidates-body-parts-republican-midterm-elections/</link><description>“我检查了他的屁股。我以前从来没有对一个男人这样做过。我检查了他的屁股。然后我看了他的肩膀。我看了他的脚。我看了他的手。我看了他的下巴。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26290710322685-e1792332128434.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:12:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/trump-miss-universe-pageant-handsome-gop-candidates-body-parts-republican-midterm-elections/</guid></item><item><title>“我们已经赢了。”阿尔伯塔省分离主义领导人誓言无论周一关键投票结果如何都会继续独立运动</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/alberta-separatist-leader-independence-movement-canada-remain-referendum-vote/</link><description>阿尔伯塔人将决定是否继续保留为一个省，还是开始就未来的分离公投启动法律程序。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2300236133-e1792331704577.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:59:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/alberta-separatist-leader-independence-movement-canada-remain-referendum-vote/</guid></item><item><title>梅琳达·法兰西·盖茨 (Melinda French Gates) 对批评员工有 48 小时的规定。这位亿万富翁慈善家表示，这是因为“说清楚就是善意”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/melinda-french-gates-48-hour-rule-for-criticizing-employees-billionaire-philanthropist-being-clear-is-kind/</link><description>这位亿万富翁慈善家的 48 小时反馈规则旨在用诚实取代愤怒，并消除绩效评估中的意外情况。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/GettyImages-2266370281-e1774552040561.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:23:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/melinda-french-gates-48-hour-rule-for-criticizing-employees-billionaire-philanthropist-being-clear-is-kind/</guid></item><item><title>Costco 首席执行官罗恩·瓦克里斯 (Ron Vachris) 在没有大学学历的情况下从叉车司机晋升为高管：“不要追逐头衔”是他成功的职业建议</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/costco-ceo-ron-vachris-career-climb-forklift-driver-to-c-suite-father-advice-dont-chase-titles-or-job-hop-stay-focused/</link><description>即使没有大学学位，Costco 首席执行官罗恩·瓦克里斯 (Ron Vachris) 在父亲的建议的指导下，从仓库地板升到了角落办公室。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Vachris-crop-Costco_05-Group_00260-1.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:20:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/costco-ceo-ron-vachris-career-climb-forklift-driver-to-c-suite-father-advice-dont-chase-titles-or-job-hop-stay-focused/</guid></item><item><title>蒂姆·库克表示，已故苹果联合创始人史蒂夫·乔布斯在卸任首席执行官一职之前给了他这条令人难忘的建议：“永远不要问我会做什么”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/tim-cook-says-apple-cofounder-steve-jobs-gave-him-unforgettable-advice-never-ask-what-i-would-do/</link><description>苹果前首席执行官蒂姆·库克表示，史蒂夫·乔布斯的建议是领导这家价值 4.86 万亿美元的科技巨头的“礼物”：“我只是低下头想，‘我将成为最好的自己。’” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/GettyImages-2170394712-e1773240333842.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:16:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/tim-cook-says-apple-cofounder-steve-jobs-gave-him-unforgettable-advice-never-ask-what-i-would-do/</guid></item><item><title>对于 Z 世代来说，一切看起来都是投资。但事实并非如此</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/for-gen-z-everything-looks-like-an-investment-but-it-isnt/</link><description>您的体育博彩和经纪应用程序可能看起来比以往更加相似，但它们不应该被同等对待。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2266704603-e1792081352315.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/for-gen-z-everything-looks-like-an-investment-but-it-isnt/</guid></item><item><title>报告发现，1000 万美国人正在使用预支贷款应用​​程序提前领取工资，这让他们多花费了数百美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/payday-advance-loan-apps-hundreds-in-fees-loan-stacking-buy-now-pay-later/</link><description>超过 95% 通过直接面向消费者的应用程序发放的发薪日贷款包含费用或自愿“小费”，而且这些额外费用正在不断增加。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2200125373-e1792023263308.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:18:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/payday-advance-loan-apps-hundreds-in-fees-loan-stacking-buy-now-pay-later/</guid></item><item><title>创新账户应该为潜在的人工智能工作所做的事情消除特朗普账户为儿童所做的事情</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/innovation-accounts-americans-ai-wealth/</link><description>“创新账户”将为成年人提供科技股票的股份，并有机会分享人工智能驱动的财富。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2298460812-e1792093272976.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/innovation-accounts-americans-ai-wealth/</guid></item><item><title>缓慢行动，创造事物：当人工智能降低速度时，日本工艺可以向企业传授质量、耐心和专业知识</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/ai-human-craft-competitive-advantage/</link><description>人工智能让生产更多产品变得更加容易。日本的职人工艺传统为制作更好的东西提供了指导。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-910585132-e1792100774164.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/ai-human-craft-competitive-advantage/</guid></item><item><title>“黄金签证”不仅仅适用于富人：阿联酋为价值 545,000 美元的购房者或护士、教师和电子竞技职业人士提供 10 年居留权</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/uae-dubai-golden-visa-nurses-teachers-expats-iran-war/</link><description>这个海湾国家的黄金签证融合了税收吸引力、投资激励和人才政策，在一个大多数居民都是外国人的国家&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2264190348-e1792160284384.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/uae-dubai-golden-visa-nurses-teachers-expats-iran-war/</guid></item></channel></rss>